# Build output. The leading slash matters: these anchor to backend-java/ only.
# Without it, "out/" also matches src/main/java/.../orders/adapter/out/ — the hexagonal
# outbound-adapter package from plan §5.3 — and git silently refuses to track anything
# inside it. That is exactly what happened to OrderPersistenceAdapter.java: it was
# created in #61, never committed, and ci-java failed to compile for 22 consecutive runs.
/.gradle/
/build/
/out/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
.idea/
*.iml
